# They still build into your own app from this folder. To share a clip you have the rights to,
# whitelist it and its thumbnail by name, e.g.:
#   !src/videos/01-my-clip.mp4
#   !src/videos/01-my-clip.jpg
src/videos/*
!src/videos/README.md

